---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy policy | HotelsViewer"
  description="What information HotelsViewer collects when you visit the site, and how it is used."
>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="small updated">Last updated: October 18, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose measure">
      <p>This policy explains what information HotelsViewer (“we”, “us”) collects when you visit this website, and how it is used.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p><strong>No analytics and no tracking cookies.</strong> We don't run analytics, advertising or tracking tools on this site at the moment, and the site itself doesn't set cookies. Fonts and photos are served from our own server, so your browser doesn't contact other companies when you read a page.</p>
      <p><strong>Server logs.</strong> Like any website, our hosting provider keeps standard server logs, such as your IP address, browser type, the pages requested and the time of the request. They are used to keep the site secure and running.</p>
      <p><strong>Messages you send.</strong> If you email us, we receive your email address and your message, and use them only to reply and to fix the page you wrote about.</p>
      <p>If we add analytics or an email newsletter later, we will update this policy before we do.</p>

      <h2>Booking links and cookies on other sites</h2>
      <p>The “Check prices” buttons lead to booking sites. Once you are there, that site and any affiliate network that runs its program may set cookies, so that a booking can be credited to us. These companies have their own privacy policies. See our <a class="text-link" href="/disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a> for how the links work.</p>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>
      <p>We use the information above to run the site, answer your messages and correct our pages. We don't sell your personal information.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Depending on where you live, you may have the right to ask what information we hold about you, or to have it deleted. To make a request, email <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>The site is not directed to children under 13, and we don't knowingly collect their personal information.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
